================================================================================
ATTRIBUTION
================================================================================

OpenFugu is an independent, open reverse-engineering and reimplementation of
the ideas behind Sakana AI's "Fugu" orchestrator family. It is NOT affiliated
with, endorsed by, or derived from Sakana AI's proprietary product code.

This repository is an API-only version of OpenFugu
(https://github.com/trotsky1997/OpenFugu). It contains no third-party model
weights or datasets.

1. TRINITY: An Evolved LLM Coordinator (arXiv:2512.04695), Sakana AI.
   The basis of the multi-turn coordinator in openfugu/mini.py. Its
   coordination loop follows the authors' released code, and its worker
   prompts are reproduced from that code, as marked in the file.

2. Learning to Orchestrate Agents in Natural Language with the Conductor
   (arXiv:2512.04388), Sakana AI. The basis of the Conductor workflow
   executor in openfugu/ultra.py, whose execution follows the authors'
   released code, as marked in the file.

3. Worker, router and Conductor models: any models reachable through litellm.
   Credentials are supplied by the user via environment variables and never
   stored.
